WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you.
Thank you, everybody.

00:00:01.668 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's very nice.
Ah, all right.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:06.740 line:92%
So, my last name is Bargatze.

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:10.076 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know nothing about
the history of my family.

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:11.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never, like,
really looked into it.

00:00:11.945 --> 00:00:16.116
So I asked a great-uncle,
told me pretty wild story.

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:18.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
We had a guy in our family
that got --

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.722 align:start size:94% position:6%
He got killed, got murdered,
actually, by a sickle.

00:00:22.722 --> 00:00:26.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like the thing
the Grim Reaper carries?

00:00:26.159 --> 00:00:28.028 line:92%
And this is like the 1800s, too,

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
just so you don't
have to feel --

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.631 size:88% position:44% line:92%
it's not a recent story.

00:00:31.631 --> 00:00:34.267 line:92%
We're over it as a family.

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.568 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
So the guy --
It was his own fault, too.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:42.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
The guy's nickname,
they called him "Two Thumbs."

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:43.843 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Two Thumbs Bargatze.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the reason
they called him that

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
was because he had two thumbs
on one hand

00:00:47.347 --> 00:00:49.449 line:92%
but still had the other thumb.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.851 line:92%
So not even a good nickname.

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:54.054 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:54.721 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I'm Two Thumbs Bargatze.

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
Everybody but him
is Two Thumbs Bargatze.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:59.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's the only not two thumbs
we've ever had

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:02.095 line:92%
in the history of our family.

00:01:02.095 --> 00:01:04.731 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I can tell you
he was a troublemaker.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
Two Thumbs, he was hooking up
with this guy's wife.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:11.137 align:start size:94% position:6%
So he's at her house,
he leaves,

00:01:11.137 --> 00:01:12.105 size:81% position:41% line:92%
the neighbor sees him.

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:15.542 size:88% position:44%
He gives him two thumbs,
one hand up, you know.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:17.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the neighbor
is like, "All right."

00:01:17.777 --> 00:01:19.512 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:21.681 size:81% position:41%
The husband gets home.
The neighbor was like,

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.783 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hey, your wife's cheating
on you with this dude."

00:01:23.783 --> 00:01:24.918 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was like,
"Who's the guy?"

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:26.352 align:start size:94% position:6%
And he was like,
"I don't know his name,

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:30.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
but he had two thumbs
on one hand, if that helps."

00:01:30.557 --> 00:01:32.125 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:34.794
And, you know, the guy was like,
"That helps a lot."

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:37.097 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:44.504
"I mean, I didn't know you were
gonna be that specific.

00:01:44.504 --> 00:01:45.905 line:92%
So I know exactly who it is."

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:49.776
So Two Thumbs was at home --
This is all what I was told.

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:50.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
He was at home,
he was gardening,

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:55.682
he was extra good at gardening,
and he's sitting there.

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.250 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's gardening,

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:58.918 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and the sickle's there,

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:00.420 line:92%
and then he kills him with it.

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:02.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
And that's it.
That's basically it.

00:02:02.322 --> 00:02:05.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
But here's the lesson.
All right, guys?

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:09.496 align:start size:94% position:6%
The lesson is if you're doing
something shady,

00:02:09.496 --> 00:02:12.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's not the time
to stand out, you know?

00:02:12.465 --> 00:02:13.933 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Like don't --

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:15.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't want to
be different then.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
Put your dumb hand
in your pocket.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:19.439 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.608
I mean, if I had three legs
and was gonna rob a bank,

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:22.876 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm gonna be
the getaway driver.

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:27.814 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not gonna gallop in
the bank with all three legs.

00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.416 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:34.787 --> 00:02:36.356 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just blend in.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:38.024 size:88% position:44% line:92%
That's the real message.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:39.859 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Just don't stand out.

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:40.760 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Just blend in.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:42.061 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sometimes you can't help it,
though.

00:02:42.061 --> 00:02:44.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've had it where,
I had it recent--

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:45.665 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I was getting coffee,

00:02:45.665 --> 00:02:47.700 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I like iced coffee
with milk.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:50.003 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nothing crazy.
And I went to order it.

00:02:50.003 --> 00:02:51.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know when you order
something

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:52.238 line:92%
and the guy looks at you weird?

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you're like,
"I'm pretty sure

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:54.340 align:start size:94% position:6%
he doesn't know
what I just said."

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you're both
touching the credit card

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.777 line:92%
so you're just too far into it.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:58.311 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And you're like,

00:02:58.311 --> 00:03:00.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
"All right, let's see
what he thinks he heard."

00:03:00.713 --> 00:03:03.716 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.716 --> 00:03:07.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I go to the end of
the counter to get my drink

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:10.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he gives me
milk with ice in it.

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:11.457 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:13.059 align:start size:94% position:6%
I had to ask him, I was like,
"What is that?"

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:15.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
He's like,
"It's milk with ice in it."

00:03:15.261 --> 00:03:15.795 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:15.795 --> 00:03:18.865
And I was like, "Do I look like
a psycho to you, dude?"

00:03:18.865 --> 00:03:20.099 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.099 --> 00:03:24.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
I've never drank milk publicly
in the history of my life.

00:03:24.437 --> 00:03:27.073
I've never once in my life
been in public and thought,

00:03:27.073 --> 00:03:29.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You know what I could go for
right now?

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:30.877 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I'd like a cup of milk.

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:31.911 size:84% position:42% line:92%
I'd like a cup of milk.

00:03:31.911 --> 00:03:33.846 size:75% position:38%
I'd like to drink it
out of a clear cup

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:36.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
so other adults know exactly
what I'm drinking."

00:03:36.983 --> 00:03:42.422 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:45.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I was also wondering if
you could put a straw in it.

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:48.995 align:start size:94% position:6%
Something I haven't done
in maybe 35 years.

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.698 size:88% position:44%
And I thought we should
do that again right now.

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:55.168
And I was wondering if you could
put milk in it and ice

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.103 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then, you know,
that's something that

00:03:57.103 --> 00:03:58.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't even know
if you're allowed to do.

00:03:58.905 --> 00:04:00.073 line:92%
But I would like to try that now

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:03.576
in front of all these people
that I've never met before."

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:05.111 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.111 --> 00:04:09.782 size:84% position:42%
The bad part about this
is it's happened twice.

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:10.850 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
All right?

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:15.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know, the first time,
that's a lot.

00:04:15.154 --> 00:04:16.055 line:92%
That's a lot for it to happen.

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:19.158 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the second time,
you start looking at yourself.

00:04:19.158 --> 00:04:21.194 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You start thinking like,

00:04:21.194 --> 00:04:22.662 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I don't know if
I know how to order.

00:04:22.662 --> 00:04:25.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not ordering correctly,"
you know?

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:27.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
I thought it was gonna happen
a third time.

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:31.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was a third time.
And she put the drink down.

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:32.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"This is unbelievable."

00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:35.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was like,
"They're against me."

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:38.678 size:84% position:42%
And -- but she just put
too much milk into it.

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.213 size:78% position:39% line:92%
And she told me that.

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:41.981 line:92%
It was a very honest moment.

00:04:41.981 --> 00:04:44.017 size:84% position:42% line:92%
She, like, set it down.

00:04:44.017 --> 00:04:46.052 line:92%
We're both looking at it.

00:04:46.052 --> 00:04:49.856
And she just is like, "Feels
like a lot of milk, doesn't it?"

00:04:49.856 --> 00:04:52.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I was like --
Just looked at it.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:54.527 line:92%
And I -- you know, was like,

00:04:54.527 --> 00:04:58.231
"Not as much as usual, but it
does still feel like a lot."

00:04:58.231 --> 00:05:00.533 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right,
thank you guys so much.

